    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέγγω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνω</span>
			, <i>make bright,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>shine, gleam,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλογὶ φέγγεται λειμών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					344
				</span></i>
			(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>shine,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λαμπτὴρ φεγγέτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					26.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1714
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.8.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
